<div class="g2-stats"><div class="g2-stat"><span class="g2-stat-k">11/19: Approval</span><span class="g2-stat-v">FDA approved it in 2022 (he wrote 2022 = FDA)</span></div><div class="g2-stat"><span class="g2-stat-k">Target</span><span class="g2-stat-v">EP2, not the FP receptor; receptor selectivity minimizes off-target activity</span></div><div class="g2-stat"><span class="g2-stat-k">Structure</span><span class="g2-stat-v">No longer a prostaglandin structure but a pyridine sulfonamide</span></div><div class="g2-stat"><span class="g2-stat-k">Activation</span><span class="g2-stat-v">Carboxylesterase hydrolysis to the acid, like that of the prostaglandins</span></div><div class="g2-stat"><span class="g2-stat-k">Lipophilicity</span><span class="g2-stat-v">Also quite lipophilic</span></div></div>
